  "name": "Question 15",
  "problem": "A high-speed printer in an office building has a maximum printing capacity of $640$ pages per minute; however, current production is below this maximum. Since the technician started monitoring, the printer produced $480$ and $560$ pages per minute at minutes $6$ and $12,$ respectively. What is the printer's printing rate at minute $36?$\n\n*Hint: You may assume that the printing production $E(t)$ increases at a rate that obeys an inhibited growth model, where $t$ is the time, in minutes.*",
